{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120205603385-1120_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261120212940\"/><p>女事主捱撞倒地。</p><p>灣仔發生交通意外。今晚(20日)8時29分，一輛的士由軒尼詩道右轉入菲林明道時，懷疑撞倒一名正使用行人過路處的女途人。事主血流披面，一度倒臥在路中心，其後清醒由救護車送往瑪麗醫院治理。</p><p>涉事的士右邊車頭的燈罩損毀，司機留在現場配合調查。據悉，涉事行人過路處當時是「紅公仔」，懷疑有人心急過路釀禍。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T14:03:58.501936+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T12:56:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T14:37:22.745487+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T13:57:18.516281+00:00","content_hash":"cf71db2115b8cdd0dcad663207f8faff893bd8d8310919b63e0dcfe93bad02f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}